{"kp_id": "shl-008.kp0001", "video_id": "shl-008", "type": "concept_definition", "statement": "厥阴为肝与心包；少阴寒湿未治则传入。寒热错杂为本篇核心。", "entity_ids": ["six_channel.jueyin"], "chapter_id": "shl-008.c01", "evidence_quote": "少阴在没好的时候，这个寒湿阴寒症会进入厥阴进入肝脏里面去", "seg_from": 3, "seg_to": 9, "start_s": 17.12, "end_s": 64.97, "citation": {"youtube_id": "7VK465ZyRMg", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7VK465ZyRMg&t=17s", "series": "shl", "episode": 8, "title": "倪海廈《傷寒論》細分版： 8厥陰症", "start_s": 17.12, "end_s": 64.97}, "confidence": 0.95, "asr_note": "", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "shl-008.kp0002", "video_id": "shl-008", "type": "clause_interpretation", "statement": "第326条提纲：消渴、气上撞心、心中疼热、饥不欲食、食则吐蛔、下之利不止。", "entity_ids": ["clause.shl.326", "six_channel.jueyin"], "chapter_id": "shl-008.c01", "evidence_quote": "气上壮心，心中疼热，饥饿不欲食", "seg_from": 34, "seg_to": 34, "start_s": 183.97, "end_s": 193.94, "citation": {"youtube_id": "7VK465ZyRMg", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7VK465ZyRMg&t=183s", "series": "shl", "episode": 8, "title": "倪海廈《傷寒論》細分版： 8厥陰症", "start_s": 183.97, "end_s": 193.94}, "confidence": 0.9, "asr_note": "壮心=撞心；吐油=吐蛔；下肢夜=下之利", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "shl-008.kp0003", "video_id": "shl-008", "type": "diagnostic_rule", "statement": "先厥后发热而利者必自止——发热示阳回；厥阴见热多为吉象。", "entity_ids": ["clause.shl.331", "six_channel.jueyin"], "chapter_id": "shl-008.c02", "evidence_quote": "伤寒先缺，后后发热，先冷啊，后面发热下利必制止", "seg_from": 249, "seg_to": 251, "start_s": 1411.288, "end_s": 1428.623, "citation": {"youtube_id": "7VK465ZyRMg", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7VK465ZyRMg&t=1411s", "series": "shl", "episode": 8, "title": "倪海廈《傷寒論》細分版： 8厥陰症", "start_s": 1411.29, "end_s": 1428.62}, "confidence": 0.85, "asr_note": "先缺=先厥", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "shl-008.kp0004", "video_id": "shl-008", "type": "contraindication", "statement": "厥阴禁发汗：下利反汗则口伤烂赤。退热靠利尿，非汗非下。", "entity_ids": ["six_channel.jueyin"], "chapter_id": "shl-008.c02", "evidence_quote": "厥阴下肢和反发汗者比口腔好烂刺", "seg_from": 326, "seg_to": 334, "start_s": 1792.778, "end_s": 1863.508, "citation": {"youtube_id": "7VK465ZyRMg", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7VK465ZyRMg&t=1792s", "series": "shl", "episode": 8, "title": "倪海廈《傷寒論》細分版： 8厥陰症", "start_s": 1792.78, "end_s": 1863.51}, "confidence": 0.9, "asr_note": "下肢=下利；比口腔烂=口伤烂赤", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "shl-008.kp0005", "video_id": "shl-008", "type": "diagnostic_rule", "statement": "脏厥：脉微而厥、躁无暂安；蛔厥：常自吐蛔，静而复时烦。", "entity_ids": ["clause.shl.338"], "chapter_id": "shl-008.c02", "evidence_quote": "跟油厥不一样，好里面肚子有虫油厥呢，其人常治吐油", "seg_from": 365, "seg_to": 369, "start_s": 2056.958, "end_s": 2103.823, "citation": {"youtube_id": "7VK465ZyRMg", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7VK465ZyRMg&t=2056s", "series": "shl", "episode": 8, "title": "倪海廈《傷寒論》細分版： 8厥陰症", "start_s": 2056.96, "end_s": 2103.82}, "confidence": 0.85, "asr_note": "油厥=蛔厥；吐油=吐蛔", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "shl-008.kp0006", "video_id": "shl-008", "type": "formula_indication", "statement": "乌梅丸：安蛔、止久利；寒热错杂（肠寒心包热）、逢考下利等神经质泄泻亦常用。", "entity_ids": ["formula.wu_mei_wan"], "chapter_id": "shl-008.c03", "evidence_quote": "乌梅丸了又足，除了足去虫以外，最主要还有酒粒", "seg_from": 373, "seg_to": 395, "start_s": 2130.498, "end_s": 2285.463, "citation": {"youtube_id": "7VK465ZyRMg", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7VK465ZyRMg&t=2130s", "series": "shl", "episode": 8, "title": "倪海廈《傷寒論》細分版： 8厥陰症", "start_s": 2130.5, "end_s": 2285.46}, "confidence": 0.9, "asr_note": "酒粒=久利", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "shl-008.kp0007", "video_id": "shl-008", "type": "herb_property", "statement": "当归至厥阴篇始重用；仲景非必要不用当归，健康人不必补血。", "entity_ids": ["herb.dang_gui", "six_channel.jueyin"], "chapter_id": "shl-008.c03", "evidence_quote": "都看不到到厥阴病才看到的当归", "seg_from": 457, "seg_to": 459, "start_s": 2619.244, "end_s": 2638.269, "citation": {"youtube_id": "7VK465ZyRMg", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7VK465ZyRMg&t=2619s", "series": "shl", "episode": 8, "title": "倪海廈《傷寒論》細分版： 8厥陰症", "start_s": 2619.24, "end_s": 2638.27}, "confidence": 0.9, "asr_note": "", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "shl-008.kp0008", "video_id": "shl-008", "type": "diagnostic_rule", "statement": "厥而见热象（舌干裂、脉大、手热、小便黄）→白虎，勿误投四逆越冷。", "entity_ids": ["formula.bai_hu_tang"], "chapter_id": "shl-008.c04", "evidence_quote": "白虎汤出现的时候，你绝对不会miss掉", "seg_from": 571, "seg_to": 587, "start_s": 3298.174, "end_s": 3420.484, "citation": {"youtube_id": "7VK465ZyRMg", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7VK465ZyRMg&t=3298s", "series": "shl", "episode": 8, "title": "倪海廈《傷寒論》細分版： 8厥陰症", "start_s": 3298.17, "end_s": 3420.48}, "confidence": 0.85, "asr_note": "", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "shl-008.kp0009", "video_id": "shl-008", "type": "clinical_tip", "statement": "西医言需截肢、末梢冰冷、冻疮等，可思当归四逆汤。内有久寒呕者加吴茱萸生姜。", "entity_ids": ["formula.dang_gui_si_ni_tang"], "chapter_id": "shl-008.c05", "evidence_quote": "糖尿病的病人呢，到后来要截肢，也是当归四逆汤症啊", "seg_from": 611, "seg_to": 674, "start_s": 3528.844, "end_s": 3927.484, "citation": {"youtube_id": "7VK465ZyRMg", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7VK465ZyRMg&t=3528s", "series": "shl", "episode": 8, "title": "倪海廈《傷寒論》細分版： 8厥陰症", "start_s": 3528.84, "end_s": 3927.48}, "confidence": 0.9, "asr_note": "", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "shl-008.kp0010", "video_id": "shl-008", "type": "formula_composition", "statement": "当归四逆汤：桂枝汤去生姜，加当归、细辛、通草（木通）；温经通脉养血。", "entity_ids": ["formula.dang_gui_si_ni_tang", "herb.dang_gui", "herb.xi_xin"], "chapter_id": "shl-008.c05", "evidence_quote": "桂枝汤，把生姜拿掉，加上当归细心跟木通，通草就是木通", "seg_from": 616, "seg_to": 620, "start_s": 3549.354, "end_s": 3581.839, "citation": {"youtube_id": "7VK465ZyRMg", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7VK465ZyRMg&t=3549s", "series": "shl", "episode": 8, "title": "倪海廈《傷寒論》細分版： 8厥陰症", "start_s": 3549.35, "end_s": 3581.84}, "confidence": 0.95, "asr_note": "细心=细辛", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "shl-008.kp0011", "video_id": "shl-008", "type": "treatment_principle", "statement": "大汗出热不去无他症→白虎；阳亡外脱须急用四逆汤挽阳。", "entity_ids": ["formula.bai_hu_tang", "formula.si_ni_tang"], "chapter_id": "shl-008.c05", "evidence_quote": "要赶快下手四逆汤", "seg_from": 701, "seg_to": 710, "start_s": 4090.974, "end_s": 4150.994, "citation": {"youtube_id": "7VK465ZyRMg", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7VK465ZyRMg&t=4090s", "series": "shl", "episode": 8, "title": "倪海廈《傷寒論》細分版： 8厥陰症", "start_s": 4090.97, "end_s": 4150.99}, "confidence": 0.85, "asr_note": "", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "shl-008.kp0012", "video_id": "shl-008", "type": "formula_composition", "statement": "干姜黄连黄芩人参汤：干姜与芩连寒热并投，人参补中；治寒格、食入口即吐。", "entity_ids": ["formula.gan_jiang_huang_qin_huang_lian_ren_shen_tang"], "chapter_id": "shl-008.c05", "evidence_quote": "干姜、黄连、黄芪人参汤，所以看好姜是热药皇情，黄帝是寒凉的药", "seg_from": 809, "seg_to": 878, "start_s": 4730.127, "end_s": 5116.937, "citation": {"youtube_id": "7VK465ZyRMg", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7VK465ZyRMg&t=4730s", "series": "shl", "episode": 8, "title": "倪海廈《傷寒論》細分版： 8厥陰症", "start_s": 4730.13, "end_s": 5116.94}, "confidence": 0.9, "asr_note": "黄芪/黄帝=黄芩", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "shl-008.kp0013", "video_id": "shl-008", "type": "diagnostic_rule", "statement": "厥热胜复：热多厥少当愈，厥多热少病进——可验温阳药是否中的。", "entity_ids": ["six_channel.jueyin"], "chapter_id": "shl-008.c06", "evidence_quote": "如果冷的时间比热的时间多，这个病成是死啊，热的时间比冷的时间多，是不是生", "seg_from": 904, "seg_to": 906, "start_s": 5248.917, "end_s": 5278.552, "citation": {"youtube_id": "7VK465ZyRMg", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7VK465ZyRMg&t=5248s", "series": "shl", "episode": 8, "title": "倪海廈《傷寒論》細分版： 8厥陰症", "start_s": 5248.92, "end_s": 5278.55}, "confidence": 0.9, "asr_note": "", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "shl-008.kp0014", "video_id": "shl-008", "type": "formula_indication", "statement": "下利清谷、里寒外热、汗出而厥→通脉四逆汤。", "entity_ids": ["formula.tong_mai_si_ni_tang"], "chapter_id": "shl-008.c07", "evidence_quote": "好米饭都在里面里寒外热好汗珠而觉得通脉四逆汤", "seg_from": 1068, "seg_to": 1070, "start_s": 6210.571, "end_s": 6229.766, "citation": {"youtube_id": "7VK465ZyRMg", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7VK465ZyRMg&t=6210s", "series": "shl", "episode": 8, "title": "倪海廈《傷寒論》細分版： 8厥陰症", "start_s": 6210.57, "end_s": 6229.77}, "confidence": 0.85, "asr_note": "米饭=利清谷", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "shl-008.kp0015", "video_id": "shl-008", "type": "formula_indication", "statement": "热利下重→白头翁汤；脓血久利可合桃花汤。渴欲饮水者热利易治。", "entity_ids": ["formula.bai_tou_weng_tang", "formula.tao_hua_tang"], "chapter_id": "shl-008.c07", "evidence_quote": "就是白头，红汤好疟疾，祸乱都会有这种情形吗", "seg_from": 1091, "seg_to": 1115, "start_s": 6321.581, "end_s": 6470.451, "citation": {"youtube_id": "7VK465ZyRMg", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7VK465ZyRMg&t=6321s", "series": "shl", "episode": 8, "title": "倪海廈《傷寒論》細分版： 8厥陰症", "start_s": 6321.58, "end_s": 6470.45}, "confidence": 0.85, "asr_note": "白头红=白头翁", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "shl-008.kp0016", "video_id": "shl-008", "type": "treatment_principle", "statement": "下利腹胀满身疼痛：先温里，后攻表；有里寒时先四逆再桂枝，勿先麻黄发表。", "entity_ids": ["clause.shl.372", "formula.si_ni_tang", "formula.gui_zhi_tang"], "chapter_id": "shl-008.c07", "evidence_quote": "先温理再宫表，这个就是原则哦", "seg_from": 1100, "seg_to": 1110, "start_s": 6360.461, "end_s": 6440.841, "citation": {"youtube_id": "7VK465ZyRMg", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7VK465ZyRMg&t=6360s", "series": "shl", "episode": 8, "title": "倪海廈《傷寒論》細分版： 8厥陰症", "start_s": 6360.46, "end_s": 6440.84}, "confidence": 0.9, "asr_note": "温理=温里；宫表=攻表", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "shl-008.kp0017", "video_id": "shl-008", "type": "diagnostic_rule", "statement": "下利而谵语者仍属大承气（热结旁流），非虚利。", "entity_ids": ["formula.da_cheng_qi_tang"], "chapter_id": "shl-008.c07", "evidence_quote": "有下令战誉者造师，你看还是大神器", "seg_from": 1120, "seg_to": 1123, "start_s": 6495.141, "end_s": 6516.846, "citation": {"youtube_id": "7VK465ZyRMg", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7VK465ZyRMg&t=6495s", "series": "shl", "episode": 8, "title": "倪海廈《傷寒論》細分版： 8厥陰症", "start_s": 6495.14, "end_s": 6516.85}, "confidence": 0.85, "asr_note": "战誉=谵语；大神器=大承气", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "shl-008.kp0018", "video_id": "shl-008", "type": "formula_indication", "statement": "干呕、吐涎沫、头痛（颠顶/印堂）→吴茱萸汤；厥阴见呕而发热为病退向少阳。", "entity_ids": ["formula.wu_zhu_yu_tang", "clause.shl.378"], "chapter_id": "shl-008.c08", "evidence_quote": "干呕恶心、土岩木头痛者吴茱妤汤组织", "seg_from": 1163, "seg_to": 1180, "start_s": 6760.271, "end_s": 6891.462, "citation": {"youtube_id": "7VK465ZyRMg", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7VK465ZyRMg&t=6760s", "series": "shl", "episode": 8, "title": "倪海廈《傷寒論》細分版： 8厥陰症", "start_s": 6760.27, "end_s": 6891.46}, "confidence": 0.9, "asr_note": "土岩木=吐涎沫", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "shl-008.kp0019", "video_id": "shl-008", "type": "contraindication", "statement": "厥阴寒湿禁妄攻下；下之则死。善后可用理中、补中类，分消治脾积腹水。", "entity_ids": ["six_channel.jueyin"], "chapter_id": "shl-008.c09", "evidence_quote": "他厥阴病的候不能攻下理，寒湿的时候，你一攻下就死掉", "seg_from": 1253, "seg_to": 1286, "start_s": 7287.017, "end_s": 7501.522, "citation": {"youtube_id": "7VK465ZyRMg", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7VK465ZyRMg&t=7287s", "series": "shl", "episode": 8, "title": "倪海廈《傷寒論》細分版： 8厥陰症", "start_s": 7287.02, "end_s": 7501.52}, "confidence": 0.9, "asr_note": "", "source": "llm_read"}
